  "post_title": "Pilates y Feria del Libro conviven en la Semana Cultural de Onda",
  "post_date": "2013-05-30 19:51:26",
  "post_name": "pilates-y-feria-del-libro-conviven-en-la-semana-cultural-de-onda",
